Privacy Policy

Last Updated: 7/15/2026 12:39am

This Privacy Policy explains what information the Bot collects and how it is used.

1. Information Collected

The Bot may collect and store:

Discord User IDs
Discord Server IDs
User economy data
Moderation records (such as warnings or actions)
Server configuration settings
Information required for Bot functionality
2. How Data Is Used

Collected data is used only to provide and improve Bot features, including:

Maintaining economy systems
Tracking moderation actions
Storing server preferences
Enforcing Bot functionality
3. Data Sharing

The Bot does not sell or share stored data with third parties unless required by law or necessary to provide the service.

4. Data Removal

Server administrators or users may request deletion of stored data where applicable. Some records may be retained if required for moderation history or security purposes.

5. Security

Reasonable measures are taken to protect stored data; however, no system can guarantee complete security.

